&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Everyone makes an impact.&lt;/strong&gt; Whether you write code, shape products, tell our story, or run the business, we want people who own projects end to end, stay curious, and speak up. Join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learn more at: NewsBreak, Nearby AI, NDot AI&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About The Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NewsBreak is looking for an analytical, growth-minded Account Manager to join our Ad Platform team. In this role, you will manage a portfolio of performance advertisers across the App vertical.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your primary focus will be driving account revenue growth through campaign optimization and scale, while leading cross-functional collaboration internally to champion platform improvements and drive client adoption of new ad products. As a trusted growth consultant, you will partner closely with advertisers, media buyers, and internal teams to maximize client ROI (ROAS, CPA, CAC) on NewsBreak.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Revenue Growth, Campaign Optimization &amp;amp; Scale&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own quarterly retention and revenue growth targets across your dedicated client portfolio, identifying high-value opportunities to unlock incremental budgets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously monitor, analyze, and optimize performance campaigns to ensure advertisers consistently meet and exceed target KPIs (ROAS, CPA, CPI, LTV).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide proactive, data-driven optimization strategies across bidding tactics, audience targeting, conversion funnels, and creative refresh cycles to scale daily ad spend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct regular performance reviews and Quarterly Business Reviews (QBRs), translating complex campaign data into compelling, revenue-generating stories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify spend barriers early, troubleshoot attribution gaps, and execute structured save and re-activation plans for at-risk or stalled accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration &amp;amp; Product Advocacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product, Engineering, and Ad Operations teams to serve as the voice of the customer, translating client feedback into actionable platform improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive platform adoption by educating clients on NewsBreak&#39;s latest bidding algorithms, native ad formats, targeting tools, and measurement solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead product testing roadmaps and alpha/beta programs, collaborating cross-functionally from technical setup and campaign launch to post-test evaluation and feedback loops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot complex technical integrations (pixels, SDKs, server-to-server tracking) alongside internal ad ops and technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in account management, customer success, or performance media buying within digital advertising or ad tech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of growing account revenue, optimizing campaign performance to scale spend, and driving product feature adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to work cross-functionally with Product, Engineering, and Ad Operations teams to resolve client issues and influence feature roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep technical understanding of biddable auction advertising, ad server technology, pixel setup, and event tracking/attribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills: ability to turn raw performance data into actionable campaign optimizations and revenue opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication and presentation skills, with experience delivering data-backed QBRs to client decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Business, Marketing, Economics, or related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing campaigns in the Mobile App (User Acquisition/App Install) vertical&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Mobile Measurement Partners (AppsFlyer, Adjust, Singular) and server-to-server tracking integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience scaling ad spend on self-serve auction platforms (e.g., Meta Ads Manager, TikTok Ads Manager, Google Ads).&lt;/li&gt;
