&lt;p&gt;NewsBreak is looking for an &lt;strong&gt;Agency Partner Manager, Scaled Growth&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Ad Platform team and help turn our agency partnerships into a consistent and scalable source of new advertisers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will work with both official and pilot agency partners across the U.S. and international markets. You will identify advertisers within each agency’s portfolio that are a strong fit for NewsBreak, guide them from onboarding through launch, and stay closely involved during their early weeks to help them reach sustained spend.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will also help pilot agencies build the knowledge, processes, and confidence needed to bring more advertisers onto NewsBreak independently. Across a large portfolio of small and long-tail advertisers, you will develop a scalable engagement model that improves activation, retention, and growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Once an advertiser reaches a sustained level of spend, you will transition the account to an Account Manager with a clear and complete handoff.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond day-to-day account growth, you will serve as an important voice of the agency market internally, translating recurring agency needs, advertiser feedback, and growth blockers into actionable priorities for Product, Data, and other cross-functional teams.&lt;/p&gt;
