&lt;p&gt;NDot AI is building a U.S.-China mini-drama ecosystem. It runs on NewsBreak&#39;s U.S. audience, distribution, recommendation and growth capabilities. We&#39;re hiring our &lt;strong&gt;founding U.S. GTM &amp;amp; Partnerships Lead&lt;/strong&gt; to build the U.S. side from the ground up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work alongside a China-based GTM counterpart. Together you&#39;ll bring short-drama producers, app developers, directors and creative talent to NewsBreak, NDot and Nova. You&#39;ll sign and activate high-quality content partners. You&#39;ll also close distribution, app-growth and monetization partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A big part of the job is connecting U.S. directors and culturally fluent creatives with Chinese production and AI-studio capacity. The goal is content that resonates with U.S. audiences and can be produced at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on 0→1 ecosystem-building role, not a traditional enterprise sales job. You&#39;ll work closely with senior leadership, product, engineering and ad sales. What you learn from partners will feed directly into NDot&#39;s product and GTM priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Map and build the U.S. ecosystem.&lt;/strong&gt; Build a prioritized map and pipeline of producers, app developers, directors and talent, production partners and strategic ecosystem players. Coordinate it with the China GTM lead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sign and activate producers.&lt;/strong&gt; Recruit high-quality mini-drama producers and content partners, with priority on content suited to U.S. audiences. Get them publishing consistently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Launch the founding-partner program.&lt;/strong&gt; Design and run producer incentives, including preferential revenue share, promotional traffic, Nova ad credits and referral rewards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Close app and monetization partnerships.&lt;/strong&gt; Turn your strongest app-developer relationships into NDot customers. Partner with the Nova ad sales team to introduce short-drama advertisers from the ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make cross-border matches.&lt;/strong&gt; Connect U.S. creative talent with Chinese production partners. Create partnerships and content that show NDot adds value beyond distribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the GTM engine.&lt;/strong&gt; Own the U.S. motion: partner segmentation, pitch, outreach, industry events, community building, PR and sales materials, CRM and forecasting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the product.&lt;/strong&gt; Turn producer needs, market insights and content performance into input for product, growth and localization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience and an established network in the mini-drama / short-drama industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior experience in GTM, BD, partnerships, producer relations or content acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record in U.S.-China cross-border business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English and Mandarin Chinese, with the cultural fluency to work credibly in both markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven skill at sourcing, negotiating and closing partnerships, and at activating producers after signing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building ecosystems or communities, including industry events, market mapping and pipeline/CRM discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong connector instincts, commercial judgment, persistence and bias for action; comfortable with ambiguity in a startup setting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Content acquisition or distribution; app growth or user acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creator or talent partnerships; a film/TV production or talent network in LA or NY&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A network of Chinese production houses or AI studios; experience with AI-content production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consumer app or short-video platform experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product and creative instincts; able to bridge creative, commercial and technical teams&lt;/li&gt;
