&lt;div class=&quot;block lang-en&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why this role exists&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The team has&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;never run a single incrementality test&lt;/strong&gt;, and — for a hyper-local product — still bids uniformly nationwide. Meanwhile an automated bidding system is being built. Without a trustworthy incrementality signal, it will shift budget at machine speed toward whatever attributes best, which is typically whatever is least incremental.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The efficiency at stake is in the eight figures annually, and it gates most other growth work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;This role sits independently, not under the media-buying team&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;— otherwise day-to-day campaign work will crowd it out.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;block lang-en&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll own&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, execution, and readout of geo holdouts and other lift tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DMA-level LTV modeling and geo-tiered bidding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;objective function&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and decision rules for the agentic bidding system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Success criteria and power requirements for product experiments, including local verticals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serving both the paid and organic growth teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;block lang-en&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;must&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on incrementality / geo-experiment experience is required&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;— familiarity with the concept is not enough; you&#39;ve designed and run them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4–8 years in marketing or growth analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent with MMPs, clear-eyed about attribution&#39;s limits, has built LTV models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong SQL and Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferred: analytics support for $20M+ in annual spend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industry open — gaming, e-commerce, subscription, and fintech all transfer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;block lang-en&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;First 90 days&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Audit spend by optimization event; build the DMA-level value table&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Launch the first geo holdout, starting with brand terms and retargeting audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver a first geo-tiered bidding proposal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
