&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creator fund / creator program / MCN experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI short-drama production and the leading AI studios; ability to judge AI-drama quality and cost&lt;/li&gt;
