&lt;li&gt;TikTok/YouTube short-drama channel or revenue-share operations experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years managing a team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep familiarity with US mainstream audience tastes and cultural context&lt;/li&gt;
