&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with hiring managers and executives to define role scope, ideal candidate profiles, and interview processes for hard-to-fill and leadership positions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employer Brand &amp;amp; Candidate Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and protect NewsBreak&#39;s employer brand to compete for top talent in a crowded Silicon Valley market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design a candidate experience that reflects NewsBreak&#39;s speed, technical bar, and culture from first touch to offer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruiting Operations &amp;amp; Systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build scalable recruiting infrastructure — ATS, sourcing tools, interview processes, and AI-powered workflow automation — to support rapid, high-quality hiring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and report hiring metrics and OKRs (time-to-fill, pipeline health, offer-accept rate, quality of hire) to leadership, using data to continuously improve the funnel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with People/HR and Finance on compensation benchmarking, leveling frameworks, and offer strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Border &amp;amp; Specialized Talent&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead sourcing strategy for frontier AI/ML talent, including specialized and cross-border pipelines (U.S. and Mandarin-speaking talent markets).&lt;/li&gt;
