&lt;li&gt;Experience in media, content, news-tech, or consumer internet companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cross-border or U.S.–China talent pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mandarin/English bilingual proficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
