&lt;p&gt;Learn more at: NewsBreak, Nearby AI, NDot AI&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Role Overview&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a data-driven, strategic Growth Marketer to accelerate partner-led acquisition and revenue growth. In this role, you will own three core growth engines: high-impact trade shows/events, global agency enablement, and strategic partner ecosystem expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate thrives at the intersection of performance marketing, relationship building, and enablement. You will work closely with global sales teams, agency partners, and tech integration platforms to drive qualified advertiser leads and scale overall ad spend.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Key Responsibilities &amp;amp; Impact&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;1. Event Planning &amp;amp; Field Marketing&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan, execute, and own ROI for key industry trade shows, high-touch events, and co-marketing initiatives globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Sales to build targeted event strategies that turn event attendees into active advertiser accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;2. Global Agency Enablement &amp;amp; Scaling&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and lead scalable enablement programs for global agency partners, including product webinars, training sessions, certification, and collateral.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product and sales teams to create self-serve documentation and toolkits that allow agencies to confidently position and execute our solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;3. Strategic Platform &amp;amp; Affiliate Partnerships&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formulate and execute integration/referral growth strategies with leading attribution, measurement, and tracking platforms, as well as affiliate networks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive co-marketing campaigns and integration-driven acquisition motions with partner platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Candidate Qualifications &amp;amp; Requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 3+ years of experience in Growth Marketing, Partner Marketing, Field Marketing, or Agency Development within B2B SaaS, AdTech, or Digital Advertising.&lt;/li&gt;
