&lt;h2&gt;The role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nearby AI is a company being built from its first months. The work that matters most right now is done by phone, in spreadsheets, in draft copy, and in conversations with customers and service professionals. Founding Associates work directly with the founding team on the marketing and operational groundwork of a new marketplace, and are measured on what they get done.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There are two tracks. You choose a primary track when you apply, and strength on either one is what we are looking for. Every associate spends part of the program on the other track so the cohort learns both sides of the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Marketing track&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creative and content experiments.&lt;/strong&gt; Draft and test ad creative, landing-page copy, and content variants with the growth lead, under the company&#39;s plain-language and compliance standards. Read the results and write up what moved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Local content production.&lt;/strong&gt; Help build the data-backed local pages and guides that form the company&#39;s organic channel: sourcing, structuring, and quality-checking content at the editorial gate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organic and AI-search tracking.&lt;/strong&gt; Track how the company&#39;s content is discovered and cited by search engines and AI assistants, and turn that into a weekly readout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Community and partnerships groundwork.&lt;/strong&gt; Map local organizations, publications, and community groups in launch markets and prepare the outreach the brand launch will use.&lt;/li&gt;
