&lt;li&gt;Savy with Claude, ChatGPT, and love to explore AI tools to build for efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with systems and platforms such as Workday, Lattice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CCP, CBP or SHRM-CP/SCP certification.&lt;/li&gt;
