&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Agency &amp;amp; Holding-Company Partnerships: &lt;/strong&gt;Establish and grow relationships with independent agencies and the major holding companies; drive sustainable revenue, product adoption, and long-term platform investment through agency channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Ecosystem Partnerships: &lt;/strong&gt;Own strategic partnerships across the digital-advertising value chain — mobile measurement partners (AppsFlyer, Adjust, Kochava), attribution and tracking companies, ad networks, DSPs/SSPs, and other adtech providers — to expand demand access, improve measurement, and strengthen platform competitiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Revenue Ownership: &lt;/strong&gt;Own the demand-side revenue goal for NewsBreak Ads end to end — targets, pipeline, forecasting, and quarter-over-quarter growth across direct, agency, and partner-sourced demand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Team Leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead, hire, and develop the growth team, including the App and Local Business Development Managers; set strategy, coach for performance, and build a repeatable, scalable go-to-market org.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Product &amp;amp; Platform Partnership: &lt;/strong&gt;Partner with Product and Engineering, feeding client and campaign performance insight back into the roadmap to improve monetization, targeting, measurement, and advertiser ROI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Go-to-Market Strategy: &lt;/strong&gt;Define pricing, packaging, and positioning for the platform in market; identify and prioritize the verticals, partners, and channels with the greatest demand upside.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Reporting: &lt;/strong&gt;Report on demand growth, pipeline health, partnership performance, and revenue to executive leadership and cross-functional stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
