&lt;h3&gt;Why this role exists&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The core product has no dedicated PM. Experience work is scattered across non-product teams and has long been aimed at “reduce negative feedback volume” — a defect metric with no established causal link to retention. This role is not just another shipper; it&#39;s someone who&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;defines the right goal for experience work&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;block lang-en&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll own&lt;/h3&gt;
