&lt;li&gt;The For You feed experience —&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;including how and when local verticals enter the main feed&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rebuilding quality triage: rank experience issues by&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;predicted churn impact&lt;/strong&gt;, not complaint volume&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scaling directions the Lead PM has validated&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing one existing PM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;block lang-en&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;must&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5–8 years in consumer product&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;with a solid shipping record&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;must&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You can quote real post-launch numbers — and explain the gap versus your forecast&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferred: feed or recommendation experience on a large-DAU product&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You run your own analysis and design your own experiments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve killed features on purpose — deciding what not to build matters as much as what to build&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;People management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;block lang-en&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;First 90 days&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce a list of experience issues&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;ranked by predicted churn impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
