&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Everyone makes an impact.&lt;/strong&gt; Whether you write code, shape products, tell our story, or run the business, we want people who own projects end to end, stay curious, and speak up. Join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learn more at: NewsBreak, Nearby AI, NDot AI&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Technical Recruiter, AI &amp;amp; Engineering to help build the teams behind our AI-powered platform. This is a high-impact, individual-contributor recruiting role for someone who thrives on owning complex technical searches end to end and wants to operate at a strategic level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll partner closely with engineering leaders and hiring managers to translate ambitious hiring plans into a rigorous, creative sourcing and closing strategy. You&#39;ll be the recruiting expert in the room — shaping role scoping, calibrating interview loops, and closing exceptional candidates in one of the most competitive technical talent markets in the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;Success in this role requires deep technical recruiting craft, sharp market instincts, and the resilience to run multiple senior-level searches simultaneously in a fast-moving AI company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;This position is 100% in-office (Monday through Friday) at our Mountain View headquarters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Work On&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-Cycle Technical Recruiting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Own full-cycle recruiting for high-impact Engineering, AI, Machine Learning, and Infrastructure roles, from senior IC to staff/principal level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Partner with hiring managers to scope roles, define success profiles, and build hiring plans aligned to team priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Manage a high volume of concurrent, often highly specialized searches without sacrificing quality or candidate experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sourcing &amp;amp; Market Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Develop and execute creative, proactive sourcing strategies to identify and engage passive talent from leading AI companies and top-tier Silicon Valley technology firms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Build and maintain a strong personal network and talent pipeline across AI/ML, backend, infrastructure, and platform engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Stay current on compensation benchmarks, competitor hiring trends, and the broader AI talent landscape to advise hiring managers with real market intelligence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate &amp;amp; Hiring Manager Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Serve as a trusted advisor to hiring managers, guiding them through role definition, interview design, and offer strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Deliver a consistently exceptional candidate experience, from first outreach through offer and close, including for senior and executive-level technical candidates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Maintain a high hiring bar through structured interview processes, calibrated scorecards, and rigorous technical assessment coordination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruiting Operations &amp;amp; Continuous Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Use recruiting data and pipeline metrics to identify bottlenecks and continuously improve time-to-fill, offer-accept rates, and funnel quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Champion AI-powered recruiting tools, sourcing automation, and process improvements to increase efficiency without sacrificing rigor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Contribute to employer branding efforts that help NewsBreak stand out to top technical talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;5+ years of technical recruiting experience, with a strong track record of full-cycle recruiting for software engineers, AI/ML engineers, infrastructure engineers, or other highly competitive technical talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Experience recruiting for high-growth Silicon Valley technology companies or AI-first organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Proven ability to independently manage multiple senior/complex searches at once, with strong prioritization and organizational skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Strong sourcing skills, including creative, proactive outreach to passive candidates through multiple channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Excellent stakeholder management skills, with the ability to build credibility with technical hiring managers and senior engineering leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Demonstrated resilience, adaptability, and comfort with ambiguity in a fast-paced, high-growth environment.&lt;/li&gt;
