&lt;li&gt;Curious about data: willing to look at CTR and CPI and edit accordingly, not just for looks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to read and write English subtitles; familiarity with overseas social ad guidelines is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI editing, subtitle and voice tools is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
