&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will define technical direction for &lt;strong&gt;large-scale personalization systems&lt;/strong&gt;, lead complex projects across teams, and drive the adoption of &lt;strong&gt;AI / LLM technologies&lt;/strong&gt; in both product capabilities and engineering workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for engineers who enjoy &lt;strong&gt;system-level thinking&lt;/strong&gt;, mentoring others, and turning ambiguous problems into scalable solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Work On&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Technical Leadership &amp;amp; Architecture&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design of &lt;strong&gt;next-generation recommendation system architectures&lt;/strong&gt; at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive best practices for &lt;strong&gt;model lifecycle management&lt;/strong&gt;, experimentation, and system reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product, infra, and data teams to align technical strategy with business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Advanced Recommendation &amp;amp; AI Systems&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own complex initiatives across &lt;strong&gt;retrieval, ranking, re-ranking, and multi-objective optimization&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
