&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Strategy &amp;amp; Ventures Lead to bring operating and investment discipline to NewsBreak&#39;s core business, our two new AI initiatives, and NexBreak Ventures. The initiatives are &lt;strong&gt;NDot AI&lt;/strong&gt;, an AI growth platform for publishers, short-drama producers and other content creators, and &lt;strong&gt;Nearby AI&lt;/strong&gt;, a local-intent marketplace. &lt;strong&gt;NexBreak Ventures&lt;/strong&gt; is our new corporate venture arm: it invests in startups and helps them grow with NewsBreak&#39;s distribution, data, AI and monetization expertise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy, BizOps &amp;amp; Analytics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate NDot AI and Nearby AI on strategy, product-market fit, progress, team, resourcing and unit economics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze growth, funnels, retention and monetization directly in our data systems (SQL / Hive / Spark) to guide strategy and operating decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build business cases and financial models that inform resource allocation and accelerate / continue / pivot / stop decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set KPIs, milestones and stage gates, and track performance against the original investment case&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run regular business reviews with initiative leaders and help them find execution gaps and resourcing needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NexBreak Ventures&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help build an active corporate venture platform from the ground up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop investment theses, source opportunities, lead diligence, model valuation and returns, and make investment recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define how NewsBreak adds value beyond capital: distribution, AI/technology, monetization, data, operating expertise and partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and monitor portfolio companies after investment, including building a portfolio-support playbook&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Corporate Development (Build / Partner / Buy)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess build, partner, invest and acquire options, and strategic transactions as they come up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3–5 years in top-tier investment banking, management consulting, corporate development, or strategy/BizOps, with meaningful exposure to technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong financial modeling skills: business cases, market sizing, unit economics and valuation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on data skills: comfortable writing SQL and working with large datasets to test assumptions yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured problem solving and clear executive communication; you turn ambiguous questions into clear recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial judgment and a willingness to challenge constructively, plus the ability to influence across functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious, proactive and low-ego; equally comfortable discussing strategy with leadership and digging into customer cohorts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Hive, Spark or Python; cohort analysis and experimentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Corporate venture, VC or growth equity experience, including sourcing and diligence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;M&amp;amp;A modeling or tech corporate development experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in marketplaces, consumer internet, media/adtech or AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empathy for founders and a strong network for sourcing deals&lt;/li&gt;
