&lt;p&gt;Learn more at: NewsBreak, Nearby AI, NDot AI&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Role Overview&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on growth role for someone who can both build the technical mechanics of growth and explain them clearly to the people who make decisions. You&#39;ll design and ship real growth loops yourself, not just recommend them, while also owning the budget, business case, and roadmap behind them. You&#39;ll be equally comfortable in the weeds of an experiment and in the room with a senior executive, brand partner, or client, translating a complex test, a cohort analysis, or a monetization result into a clear, compelling recommendation and securing buy-in to act on it. Strong technical execution matters, and so does your ability to build trust and alignment with non-technical, senior stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Roles and Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and ship technical growth mechanisms: acquisition funnels, onboarding flows, referral/viral loops, activation triggers, and monetization experiments.&lt;/li&gt;
